21:18.290 --> 21:20.190
All right, everyone! Let's go together!

21:20.390 --> 21:21.500
Towards our next adventure!

21:22.270 --> 21:23.760
The Tripokalon Master Class...

21:24.150 --> 21:25.730
The place where the Kalos Queen is crowned.

21:26.390 --> 21:28.170
This is the last event, no second chances.

21:28.730 --> 21:31.630
For this day, I've been working hard together with my Pokémon.

21:32.380 --> 21:33.410
We'll defeat Elle-san...

21:33.980 --> 21:35.630
